# .env Configuration Guide

## MySQL Configuration (Local Development)

```env
# Application
APP_NAME=EPerpus-Sawit
APP_ENV=local
APP_KEY=base64:xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
APP_DEBUG=true
APP_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Database - MySQL
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=eperpus_sawit
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=

# Mail (Optional)
MAIL_MAILER=smtp
MAIL_HOST=smtp.mailtrap.io
MAIL_PORT=465
MAIL_USERNAME=your_username
MAIL_PASSWORD=your_password

# Cache
CACHE_DRIVER=file
SESSION_DRIVER=file
QUEUE_DRIVER=sync
```

## PostgreSQL Configuration (Supabase Production)

```env
# Application
APP_NAME=EPerpus-Sawit
APP_ENV=production
APP_KEY=base64:xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
APP_DEBUG=false
APP_URL=https://your-domain.com

# Database - PostgreSQL (Supabase)
DB_CONNECTION=pgsql
DB_HOST=db.xxxxx.supabase.co
DB_PORT=5432
DB_DATABASE=postgres
DB_USERNAME=postgres
DB_PASSWORD=your_secure_password
DB_SSLMODE=require

# Cache
CACHE_DRIVER=redis
SESSION_DRIVER=redis
QUEUE_DRIVER=redis

REDIS_HOST=default-redis.xxxxx.supabase.co
REDIS_PASSWORD=your_redis_password
REDIS_PORT=6379
```

## Environment Variable Explanations

### Database Credentials (MySQL)
- `DB_HOST`: Server address (127.0.0.1 untuk localhost)
- `DB_PORT`: MySQL port (default 3306)
- `DB_DATABASE`: Database name (eperpus_sawit)
- `DB_USERNAME`: MySQL username (root)
- `DB_PASSWORD`: MySQL password (empty jika tidak ada password)

### Database Credentials (PostgreSQL/Supabase)
- `DB_HOST`: Server address dari Supabase (db.xxxxx.supabase.co)
- `DB_PORT`: PostgreSQL port (5432)
- `DB_DATABASE`: Database name (postgres)
- `DB_USERNAME`: PostgreSQL user (postgres)
- `DB_PASSWORD`: Secure password dari Supabase
- `DB_SSLMODE`: SSL mode (require untuk Supabase)

### Cara Mendapatkan Supabase Credentials

1. Login ke Supabase Dashboard
2. Pilih project Anda
3. Pergi ke Settings > Database
4. Copy connection details:
   ```
   Host: db.xxxxx.supabase.co
   Port: 5432
   User: postgres
   Password: [password yang Anda set]
   Database: postgres
   ```

---

**Note**: Jangan pernah push .env ke repository! File ini sudah di-ignore oleh .gitignore
